nd characterisation of the response of chondrocytes to mechanical load using <italic>in-situ </italic>hybridisation</article-title><source>Matrix Biol</source><year>1994</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>378</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0945-053X(94)90089-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Xie</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Chipman</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>Robertson</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><name><surname>Erikson</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Simmons</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Expression of a mitogen-responsive gene encoding prostaglandin synthase is regulated by mRNA splicing</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>1991</year><volume>88</volume><fpage>2692</fpage><lpage>2696</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1849272</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1073/pnas.88.7.2692</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vane</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Bakhle</surname><given-names>YS</given-names></name><name><surname>Botting</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cyclooxygenases 1 and 2</article-title><source>Annu Rev Pharmacol Toxicol</source><year>1998</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>97</fpage><lpage>120</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9597150</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1146/annurev.pharmtox.38.1.97</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hardy</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Seibert</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Manning</surname><given-names>PT</given-names></name><name><surname>